================================================================================
IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
================================================================================

1. Covariance Matrix Estimation:
   - Sample covariance
   - Shrinkage estimators (Ledoit-Wolf)
   - EWMA (Exponentially Weighted Moving Average)
   - Factor models

2. Expected Return Estimation:
   - Historical average
   - Factor models
   - Black-Litterman (reverse optimization)
   - ML models

3. Rebalancing Frequency:
   - Daily
   - Weekly
   - Monthly
   - Threshold-based (trigger when weights drift > threshold)

4. Constraints:
   - No short-selling: w_i ≥ 0
   - Sum to one: sum(w) = 1
   - Max individual weight: w_i ≤ max_cap
   - Sector/group caps: sum(w_i ∈ group_k) ≤ cap_k
   - Turnover constraint: sum(|w_t - w_{t-1}|) ≤ max_turnover

5. Numerical Optimization Methods:
   - Sequential Least Squares Programming (SLSQP)
   - Interior Point
   - Active Set
   - Differential Evolution (non-convex)